## Quality gate

`agents-devkits.yaml` requires `visual-qa` and `accessibility-review` whenever
configured UI paths change. Add only commands that this repository actually
supports to its matching verification condition, for example a token/hardcode
lint, `axe` browser test, responsive/overflow check, or production build.

Record the source of truth, executed commands, rendered viewports, and any
unavailable checks in the final `design-qa` or `release-check` evidence.
